<title>CHINA: Silver Grant interim net jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Silver Grant interim net jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.0	 vs 1.4 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  40.06 gain vs 8.88 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    138.35     vs 7.75</p>
<p>    Turnover		     16.50	vs 17.56</p>
<p>    Company name		 Silver Grant International</p>
<p>				     Industries Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Silver Grant engages in property leasing, investment holding and share dealing.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of listed investments during the period.</p>
<p>Share earnings for the last corresponding period has been restated as a result of the bonus issue of two bonus shares for every one share made during the period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
